{"id":"3238d7fca6c27a3f","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-satisfaction.md","title":"项求值与Tarski满足","display":"df-satisfaction — 项求值与Tarski满足","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-satisfaction","aliases":["43-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — 项求值与Tarski满足","depends_on":["[[43-df-structure]]","[[43-df-assignment]]","[[43-df-formula]]","[[43-df-term]]","[[43-df-sentence]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — 项求值与Tarski满足"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5c55ddf2aa11f80\" href=\"?note=f5c55ddf2aa11f80\" title=\"43-df-structure\">43-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b88be0fc886200c3\" href=\"?note=b88be0fc886200c3\" title=\"43-df-assignment\">43-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a4ba10013f4fc82\" href=\"?note=1a4ba10013f4fc82\" title=\"43-df-formula\">43-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"961683c3b48a18ae\" href=\"?note=961683c3b48a18ae\" title=\"43-df-term\">43-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1be181e56e937ecb\" href=\"?note=1be181e56e937ecb\" title=\"43-df-sentence\">43-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Assign}_{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Assign}_{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\">\\(c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\">\\(f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\">\\(R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L\">\\(t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L\">\\(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\)</span>。语法构造、赋值更新及结构解释采用所列本目录依赖；所有递归沿有限语法树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}:\\operatorname{Term}_L\\to A,\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(x):=\\beta(x),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(c):=I(c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}:\\operatorname{Term}_L\\to A,\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(x):=\\beta(x),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(c):=I(c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))):=I(f)(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))):=I(f)(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)[\\beta]\\iff\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)[\\beta]\\iff\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Rel}(R,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))[\\beta]\\iff(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n))\\in I(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Rel}(R,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))[\\beta]\\iff(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n))\\in I(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi)[\\beta]\\iff\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi)[\\beta]\\iff\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\iff(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\iff(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\iff(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\iff(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\iff\\bigl((\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\iff\\bigl((\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\iff\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\iff\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\iff\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\iff\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\theta\\iff\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Assign}_{\\mathfrak A}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\theta[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\theta\\iff\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Assign}_{\\mathfrak A}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\theta[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对象层的构造标签和元逻辑真值连接词在每个分支均显式区分。非空论域保证赋值存在；有限语法树递归给出唯一的项值与满足关系。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5c55ddf2aa11f80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head